---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service - NovaTools"
  description="Terms of service and usage conditions for NovaTools client-side utility suite."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10">
    <div class="space-y-3 border-b border-surface-border pb-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 font-mono">Last Updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-white">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using NovaTools (<a href="https://novatools.app" class="text-brand-400 hover:underline">novatools.app</a>), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you must discontinue use of the website immediately.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-white">2. License & Client-Side Software Use</h2>
        <p>
          NovaTools grants you a free, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use the browser-based utilities for personal and commercial document/media manipulation.
        </p>
        <p>
          Because all computation occurs directly on your client hardware, you are solely responsible for ensuring your computer or browser has sufficient processing capabilities and memory to perform file conversions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-white">3. Acceptable Use Policy</h2>
        <p>You agree not to use NovaTools to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-zinc-400">
          <li>Violate any local, national, or international copyright laws or intellectual property rights.</li>
          <li>Attempt to decompile, reverse engineer, or exploit the underlying platform in an abusive manner.</li>
          <li>Distribute malicious software or engage in unauthorized scraping or denial-of-service attempts.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-white">4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          NovaTools is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind, either express or implied. While our WebAssembly and PDF algorithms are rigorously tested, NovaTools does not guarantee that file conversions will be error-free or that specific data structures will be fully preserved in all edge-case PDF/media variations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-white">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall NovaTools or its developers be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use the tools or from accidental loss of data. Users are advised to retain original backups of their files before processing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-white">6. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to revise these Terms of Service at any time. Continued use of the platform following updates constitutes acceptance of the modified terms.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
